import "res://assets/dialogue/dialogue_scripts/7d-Az-ConditionalConvo-CellarGeneral.dialogue" as ConditionalConvo

~ start
Fenn: Winston?
Winston: OH BY POSTLY HEAVEN! WHO'S THERE?!
Fenn: It's me! Fenn?
Winston: Oh my. Pint-size...
Fenn: Alright, Wizard man! I'm ready for you, gimme everything you got. I will defeat you and free this palace!
Winston: Oh! Yes, um... well you see...
Winston: Mine own tools art in the workshop. I wast out looking for something, and-
Az: Oh by the Sender. You're LOST?!
Winston: Nay! NAY! I'm not lost! I knoweth mine own way out of here perfectly fine!
Winston mumbling: Or at least, I didst.
Az: HAHA HAH. This is GREAT. Boy you really know how to crack me up.
Winston: Arrgh. Shut up! 
Winston whispering: Hey pint-size... wh-whereth be thine exit?
Fenn: Oh, it's just behind you. I see it there.
Winston: Thanks.
Fenn: No problem, happy to help!
Winston leaves.
Az: Did you just let him get away?
Fenn: OH WAIT! Come back!!!
Winston from afar: UMMM... LALALA I CAN'T HEARETH YOU!
Az: Oh by Post. They're both idiots.
# Change this to something like "If heaters on == 0"
if true
	=> ConditionalConvo/start

=> END